---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Dataset - Atsuhiro Fujii（藤井 敦寛）"
  canonicalUrl="https://atsuhi.ro/dataset.html"
  description="研究で使用したデータセットを公開するページです．"
  imageAlt="Research datasets"
>
    <main class="container mx-auto px-6 py-12 mt-20 max-w-4xl flex-1">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm p-8 mb-8">
        <section class="mb-6">
          <h1
            class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2"
          >
            Dataset
          </h1>
          <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
            本ページでは，著者が研究で使用したデータセットを公開しています．今後，論文やプロジェクトで用いたデータセットを順次追加していく予定です．
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mt-1">
            This page provides datasets used in my research. Additional datasets
            from future publications and projects will be added here.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-4 border border-slate-200 rounded-md p-4">
          <h2
            class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2"
          >
            Water Level Recognition by Analyzing the Sound when Pouring Water
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-slate-700 text-sm space-y-1 mb-3">
            <li>
              論文情報：<a
                href="publications.html#water-level-recognition"
                class="text-slate-600 font-bold hover:underline"
                >Publicationsページ</a
              >をご覧ください<br />
              Paper: See the Publications page.
            </li>
            <li>
              内容：ボトルに水を注ぐ際の音を収録した音声データ<br />
              Content: Audio recordings of water being poured into bottles.
            </li>
            <li>
              用途：水位推定モデルの学習および評価<br />
              Usage: Training and evaluating water level recognition models.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm mb-3">
            This dataset contains audio recordings of water being poured into
            bottles, used for training and evaluating water level recognition
            models.
          </p>

          <button
            type="button"
            onclick="openDownloadDialog();"
            class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-2 bg-slate-800 text-white rounded-md shadow hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors text-sm font-medium cursor-pointer"
          >
            <i class="mdi mdi-download mr-2"></i>
            Download dataset
          </button>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>

    <dialog
      id="download-dialog"
      class="rounded-lg shadow-lg max-w-md p-0 border border-slate-200 mx-4 sm:mx-auto my-auto backdrop:bg-black/70"
    >
      <div class="p-6 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Download dataset</h3>

        <section>
          <h4 class="text-md font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">利用規約</h4>
          <div
            class="border border-slate-200 rounded-md p-3 text-sm text-slate-700 max-h-40 overflow-y-auto space-y-2"
          >
            <p>
              本データセットは，研究・教育などの非営利目的での利用を想定して提供されるものです．
            </p>
            <p>
              本データセットの内容，正確性，有用性，特定目的への適合性について，提供者は一切の保証を行いません．
              本データセットの利用により生じたいかなる損害・不利益についても，提供者は一切の責任を負いません．
            </p>
            <p>
              利用者は，本データセットを第三者に再配布，転売，あるいはこれらと同等とみなされる行為を行ってはなりません．
              学術論文やプレゼンテーション等において本データセットを利用した成果を公開する場合は，元論文の引用を含め，適切なクレジットを表示してください．
            </p>
            <p>
              利用者が本データセットを利用した結果については，利用者自身の責任において管理および判断するものとします．
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h4 class="text-md font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1">
            Terms of Use
          </h4>
          <div
            class="border border-slate-200 rounded-md p-3 text-sm text-slate-700 max-h-40 overflow-y-auto space-y-2"
          >
            <p>
              This dataset is provided primarily for non-commercial purposes
              such as academic research and education.
            </p>
            <p>
              The provider makes no warranties whatsoever regarding the
              completeness, accuracy, usefulness, or fitness for a particular
              purpose of this dataset. The provider shall not be liable for any
              loss or damage arising from the use of this dataset.
            </p>
            <p>
              You must not redistribute, resell, or otherwise provide this
              dataset to third parties in a manner equivalent to redistribution
              or resale. When publishing results obtained using this dataset,
              please give appropriate credit, including citation of the original
              paper.
            </p>
            <p>
              You are solely responsible for any results, decisions, or
              consequences arising from your use of this dataset.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="space-y-3 mt-2">
          <label class="flex items-center text-sm text-slate-700">
            <input id="terms-agree" type="checkbox" class="mr-2" />
            <span> 利用規約に同意する / I agree to the terms. </span>
          </label>

          <div class="flex justify-end space-x-3">
            <button
              type="button"
              onclick="closeDownloadDialog();"
              class="px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-700 hover:text-slate-900 cursor-pointer"
            >
              Cancel
            </button>
            <button
              type="button"
              onclick="handleDatasetDownload();"
              class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-2 bg-slate-800 text-white rounded-md shadow hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors text-sm font-medium cursor-pointer"
            >
              <i class="mdi mdi-download mr-2"></i>
              Download
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </dialog>

  <script is:inline slot="scripts">
    function openDownloadDialog() {
      document.getElementById('terms-agree').checked = false;
      document.getElementById('download-dialog').showModal();
    }

    function closeDownloadDialog() {
      document.getElementById('download-dialog').close();
    }

    function handleDatasetDownload() {
      const checkbox = document.getElementById('terms-agree');
      if (!checkbox || !checkbox.checked) {
        alert(
          '利用規約に同意してください．\nPlease agree to the terms before downloading.'
        );
        return;
      }
      downloadFile(
        'dataset/water_level_recognition.zip',
        'water_level_recognition_dataset.zip'
      );
      closeDownloadDialog();
    }

    function downloadFile(url, filename) {
      const link = document.createElement('a');
      link.href = url;
      link.download = filename;
      document.body.appendChild(link);
      link.click();
      document.body.removeChild(link);
    }
  </script>
</SiteLayout>
